Value NEIGHBOR (\S+)
Value LOCAL_INTERFACE (\S+\s?\S+)
Value HOLDTIME (\d+)
Value CAPABILITY (\S+(?:\s\S+)*)
Value PLATFORM (\S+)
Value NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE (\S+\s?\S+)

Start
  ^\s*${NEIGHBOR}\s+${LOCAL_INTERFACE}\s+${HOLDTIME}\s+${CAPABILITY}\s+${PLATFORM}\s+${NEIGHBOR_INTERFACE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^. -> Continue